# Test Methods

## Lateral Acceleration

### Method 1: Constant Radius Test
- Drive in a circle with known radius  
- Increase speed until failure  

a = v² / r

### Method 2: Steering Variation
- Maintain constant speed  
- Vary steering angle  

---

## Longitudinal Acceleration

### Method:
- Accelerate from 0 to max speed in a straight line  

